		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=3874#p3874"><![CDATA[
Bullet 2.46 is now available, and the Sweep and Prune broadphase can be switched to 32bit indices, allowing more objects.<br><br>Just enable <div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>#define BP_USE_FIXEDPOINT_INT_32 1</code></pre></div>in Bullet/src/BulletCollision/btAxisSweep3.h<br><br>Hope this helps,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Tue Mar 13, 2007 7:23 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
